<title>JAPAN: TIFFE Euroyen jump late, end higher on JGBs, dollar.</title>
<headline>TIFFE Euroyen jump late, end higher on JGBs, dollar.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>June 9 settlement  prev settlement</p>
<p> TIFFE Euroyen 3M (Z)     98.96		  98.88</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The key December TIFFE three-month Euroyen futures contract surged to end at the day's high in Tokyo on Monday.</p>
<p>A tumbling dollar contributed to gains in Japanese government bonds (JGB)s, boosting Euroyen futures as well. Aggressive short-covering of the key December and weaker Tokyo stocks also helped futures gain. The December settled at 98.96, up from 98.88 Friday.</p>
</text>
